{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2021-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1633046400, "end_date": 1633651199, "month_true_total": 133, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:55:46 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "100694093", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043648210", "personaname": "felipe.cerdas", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043648210/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 7787, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7090, "last_played": 1635634821, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played my second time in 2021. This game didn't deserve to be shelved, it has its shortcomings, but it laid a good foundation for so much potential. It was a fixable game, and with some good DLC would become a fine installment.", "timestamp_created": 1633639563, "timestamp_updated": 1633639563, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100673468", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023203281", "personaname": "PolWynlind", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PolWynlind/", "num_games_owned": 727, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 1642, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1635, "last_played": 1718712679, "avatar": "e2b437a3927fc522e71363a3297bfee67153cca8"}, "language": "english", "review": "While not perfect, I believe Andromeda got a bad rap back in 2017 due to largely technical issues that have been largely ironed out by official patches. It's not perfect and it's story is rather bland considering the setup but it is still an enjoyable experience and a must play for any fan of the series.", "timestamp_created": 1633612290, "timestamp_updated": 1633612290, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100634993", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975993057", "personaname": "Deci-Mat-e", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Dec-Mat-e/", "num_games_owned": 192, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 5426, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5426, "last_played": 1633539110, "avatar": "926dda5abf48ec4e0138712ed367e479df0e6ed4"}, "language": "english", "review": "It’s taken me 90-hours to finish the game, and I thought it was an excellent Mass Effect experience. Comparing it to the original trilogy isn’t a fair comparison. Comparing it to ME1, given all the new characters being introduced, and ME Andromeda is loads more fun. There were times I was moved and times I laughed aloud. And whilst it is somewhat of a slow burn, it ramps up towards the end. Some caveats … I installed several of the recommended mods to fix bugs and improve gameplay. I ignored most of the fetch quests (obtain so many of) of which there are a few but by no means overwhelming (I’m looking at you Ubisoft). And now it’s over I’m sad. With better management, this could have been the start of something to rival the original trilogy, and gaming is poorer that that didn’t happen.", "timestamp_created": 1633546377, "timestamp_updated": 1633546377, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"rec